' MovieService — class that returns Movie instances.
'
' Note on filename: this lives under source/models/ (not source/services/) to
' avoid a transpile collision with the existing source/services/MovieService.brs
' (function-based module). Both can co-exist because:
'   - The class identifier `MovieService` does not collide with the
'     function-prefixed names `MovieService_getCatalogue`, etc.
'   - Different folders -> distinct files in build/staging.

class MovieService
    function getMovies() as object
        return [
            new Movie("Inception", 2010, 8.8, 148)
            new Movie("Interstellar", 2014, 8.6, 169)
            new Movie("Tenet", 2020, 7.4, 150)
            new Movie("Oppenheimer", 2023, 8.3, 180)
            new Movie("Dunkirk", 2017, 7.9, 106)
            new Movie("The Prestige", 2006, 8.5, 130)
        ]
    end function
end class
